  S1["1. 30 Oct, evening: the feed stops sending<br/>five_hour for verified Ultra accounts. The app<br/>keeps the last figure (63% in this example) and<br/>draws it as live: countdown running, tick<br/>moving, 'Over pace limit 22:50 at this rate'.<br/><i>broken</i>"]:::broken
  S2["2. Near the stored reset the same 63% reads 'Ahead<br/>66% by reset', '185% an hour left'.<br/><i>broken</i>"]:::broken
  S3["3. If the 5h window was at 100% when the feed<br/>stopped, the panda shows - - eyes and VoiceOver<br/>says '5h limit reached' until the old reset.<br/><i>broken</i>"]:::broken
  S4["4. Around the old reset a '5h window ends in 15<br/>min' nudge can fire for it.<br/><i>broken</i>"]:::broken
  S5["5. Today, 31 Oct: the 5h window is an empty bar<br/>with 'Reset 00:10 no session since', under<br/>'Usage live' and a listed open session, and it<br/>stays that way for good. The smallest fix drops<br/>the window when a fresh feed comes without it.<br/><i>broken</i>"]:::broken
  S6["6. A new Ultra user, whose feed never had<br/>five_hour, sees an empty 5h bar with 'not in<br/>the last feed' for good.<br/><i>friction</i>"]:::friction
  S7["7. Max and Pro feeds still carry five_hour; their<br/>panel is unchanged.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
